WEBVTT

00:00:04.194 --> 00:00:06.457
HERMIONE:
Harry.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:07.807
Hello.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.288
What a lovely surprise.

00:00:11.332 --> 00:00:13.160
[MOLLY LAUGHING]

00:00:13.203 --> 00:00:15.597
Why didn't you let us know
you were coming?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.816
I didn't know. Dumbledore.

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:18.687
Oh, that man.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.994
But then, what would we do
without him?

00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:24.911
Got a bit of toothpaste.

00:00:32.005 --> 00:00:33.093
So when did you get here?

00:00:33.136 --> 00:00:36.313
A few days ago.

00:00:36.357 --> 00:00:38.707
Though for a while,
I wasn't sure I was coming.

00:00:40.491 --> 00:00:42.798
Mum sort of lost it
last week.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.975
Said Ginny and I had no business
going back to Hogwarts.

00:00:46.019 --> 00:00:47.498
That it's too dangerous.

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:50.501
Oh, come on.She's not alone.

00:00:50.545 --> 00:00:52.242
Even my parents,
and they're Muggles,

00:00:52.286 --> 00:00:54.027
know something bad's happening.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:58.205
Anyway, Dad stepped in,
told her she was being barmy

00:00:58.248 --> 00:01:00.772
and it took a few days,
but she came around.

00:01:00.816 --> 00:01:03.253
But this is Hogwarts
we're talking about.

00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:05.342
It's Dumbledore.
What could be safer?

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:10.521
There's been a lot of talk
recently that

00:01:10.565 --> 00:01:12.349
Dumbledore's got a bit old.

00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:14.351
Rubbish. Well, he's only--

00:01:14.395 --> 00:01:16.136
What is he?

00:01:16.179 --> 00:01:19.530
Hundred and fifty?
Give or take a few years.

00:01:19.574 --> 00:01:22.229
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:01:25.449 --> 00:01:27.451
[♪♪♪]

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:43.380
BELLATRIX:
Cissy! You can't do this!
He can't be trusted!

00:01:43.424 --> 00:01:45.034
NARCISSA:
The Dark Lord trusts him.

00:01:45.078 --> 00:01:48.733
BELLATRIX:
The Dark Lord's mistaken.

00:01:48.777 --> 00:01:51.780
[CHILDREN CHATTERING]

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:00.963
[KNOCKING]

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:20.200
SNAPE:
Run along, Wormtail.

00:02:23.072 --> 00:02:25.466
I-I know I ought not to be here.

00:02:26.815 --> 00:02:29.731
The Dark Lord himself
forbade me to speak of this.

00:02:29.774 --> 00:02:31.515
If the Dark Lord
has forbidden it,

00:02:31.559 --> 00:02:33.517
you ought not to speak.
Put it down, Bella.

00:02:33.561 --> 00:02:36.825
We mustn't touch
what isn't ours.

00:02:41.003 --> 00:02:44.789
As it so happens, I'm aware
of your situation, Narcissa.

00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:46.008
BELLATRIX:
You?

00:02:46.052 --> 00:02:49.446
The Dark Lord told you?

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:53.450
Your sister doubts me.

00:02:53.494 --> 00:02:56.497
Understandable. Over the years
I've played my part well.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.151
So well,
I've deceived one

00:02:58.194 --> 00:03:00.370
of the greatest wizards
of all time.

00:03:00.414 --> 00:03:02.111
[BELLATRIX SNORTS]

00:03:02.155 --> 00:03:05.810
Dumbledore is a great wizard.
Only a fool would question it.

00:03:05.854 --> 00:03:07.812
I don't doubt you, Severus.

00:03:07.856 --> 00:03:10.685
You should be honored, Cissy.
As should Draco.

00:03:15.516 --> 00:03:18.171
He's just a boy.

00:03:18.214 --> 00:03:21.217
I can't change
the Dark Lord's mind.

00:03:22.871 --> 00:03:26.527
But it might be possible
for me to help Draco.

00:03:28.311 --> 00:03:31.184
NARCISSA: Severus.Swear to it.

00:03:35.318 --> 00:03:38.017
Make the Unbreakable Vow.

00:03:41.281 --> 00:03:44.806
It's just empty words.

00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:48.157
He'll give it his best effort.

00:03:48.201 --> 00:03:52.118
But when it matters most

00:03:52.161 --> 00:03:56.383
he'll just slither back
into his hole.

00:03:59.908 --> 00:04:01.518
Coward.

00:04:04.565 --> 00:04:08.177
Take out your wand.

00:04:21.277 --> 00:04:22.496
Will you,

00:04:22.539 --> 00:04:24.846
Severus Snape

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:27.892
watch over Draco Malfoy

00:04:27.936 --> 00:04:32.767
as he attempts to fulfill
the Dark Lord's wishes?

00:04:33.942 --> 00:04:35.813
I will.

00:04:37.206 --> 00:04:41.515
And will you,
to the best of your ability

00:04:41.558 --> 00:04:43.778
protect him from harm?

00:04:45.214 --> 00:04:46.520
I will.

00:04:48.609 --> 00:04:51.090
BELLATRIX:
And if Draco should fail...

00:04:52.178 --> 00:04:57.008
will you yourself
carry out the deed

00:04:57.052 --> 00:05:01.317
the Dark Lord
has ordered Draco to perform?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.803
I will.

00:05:10.196 --> 00:05:12.198
[♪♪♪]

00:05:21.163 --> 00:05:23.122
[LAUGHTER]

00:05:31.521 --> 00:05:34.611
Step up. Step up.
We've got Fainting Fancies.

00:05:34.655 --> 00:05:36.091
Nosebleed Nougats!

00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:39.050
And just in time for school.Puking Pastilles.

00:05:40.443 --> 00:05:43.185
Into the cauldron, handsome.Into the cauldron, handsome.

00:05:47.668 --> 00:05:50.888
WOMAN:
I will have order!

00:05:50.932 --> 00:05:52.238
I really hate children.

00:05:52.281 --> 00:05:55.806
I will have order!

00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:58.766
Peruvian Instant Darkness
Powder.

00:05:58.809 --> 00:06:00.159
A real money spinner, that.

00:06:00.202 --> 00:06:02.204
Handy if you need
to make a quick getaway.

00:06:02.248 --> 00:06:04.250
GEORGE: Hello, ladies.FRED: Hello, ladies.

00:06:04.293 --> 00:06:07.644
Love potions, eh?Yeah, they really do work.

00:06:07.688 --> 00:06:09.211
Then again,
the way we hear it, sis,

00:06:09.255 --> 00:06:11.126
you're doing just fine
on your own.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.780
Meaning?

00:06:12.823 --> 00:06:14.738
GEORGE:
Are you not currently dating
Dean Thomas?

00:06:14.782 --> 00:06:16.958
It's none of your business.

00:06:22.529 --> 00:06:23.834
RON:
How much for this?

00:06:23.878 --> 00:06:25.401
Five Galleons.Five Galleons.

00:06:25.445 --> 00:06:27.577
How much for me?Five Galleons.

00:06:27.621 --> 00:06:29.013
I'm your brother.

00:06:29.057 --> 00:06:31.364
Ten Galleons.Ten Galleons.

00:06:33.279 --> 00:06:34.976
RON:
Come on, let's go.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.502
Hi, Ron.

00:06:39.546 --> 00:06:40.895
Hi.

